 continued the same-stage work by checking whether the source object could be represented without assuming the desired conclusion. A faithful H004 interface must encode a complex highest-weight module, an arbitrary Z-lattice with a Z-basis that is a C-basis, divided-power stability, and the actual tensor_Z K scalar extension with induced x,y,h actions. I have not constructed or elaborated that interface, and therefore cannot honestly submit a JSON artifact as source-faithful. Replacing it with a standard basis, assuming the reduced action formulas, or defining irreducibility by an input field would change or assume the accepted theorem.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"The exact H004/P statements and S001–S008 route in source-map.json; task contract prohibits stronger assumptions, equivalent views without proved conversions, and conclusion-hidden structure fields. No checker feedback exists because no artifact has been checked.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"All task inputs and required Yui translation, architecture, and Audit B rules were read earlier. Source route was mapped; no artifact or Lean proof is claimed.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id